{
  "name": "HL·01 Intake",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## HL·01 Intake (lesson 6.4, core loop)\nWhatsApp Cloud API trigger → log the message to events → kill switch → classifier: orders to HL·02, questions to HL·05 (Sage Desk), \"unsure\" to HL·05, the agent that can ask.\n\n**Credentials:** WhatsApp Trigger (Meta app), WhatsApp (access token) for the HTTP node, Postgres (Supabase), OpenAI (or your provider), Telegram.\n**Replace:** YOUR_WHATSAPP_PHONE_NUMBER_ID, YOUR_HL02_WORKFLOW_ID, YOUR_HL05_WORKFLOW_ID, YOUR_TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID, model YOUR_MODEL (pick a small, cheap one).",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 400
      },
      "id": "f9c0ad92-09b4-46d3-8fa8-4a33db56c896",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -528,
        -251
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "updates": [
          "messages"
        ]
      },
      "id": "e1a4aa8e-8d11-471a-8cc3-ca5ccde29f4c",
      "name": "WhatsApp Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.whatsAppTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// One item per incoming text message; delivery statuses are ignored.\nconst out = [];\nfor (const it of $input.all()) {\n  const j = it.json;\n  const v = j.messages ? j : (j.entry?.[0]?.changes?.[0]?.value ?? j);\n  for (const m of (v.messages || [])) {\n    const text = m.text?.body ?? m.button?.text ?? m.interactive?.button_reply?.title ?? '';\n    const contact = (v.contacts || []).find(c => c.wa_id === m.from) || {};\n    out.push({ json: {\n      wa_id: m.from,\n      phone: '+' + String(m.from).replace(/\\D/g, ''),\n      name: contact.profile?.name || '',\n      message_id: m.id,\n      type: m.type,\n      text,\n      received_at: new Date(Number(m.timestamp) * 1000).toISOString()\n    } });\n  }\n}\nreturn out;"
      },
      "id": "a939dd21-8da8-45f5-a455-bd99ba34246d",
      "name": "Normalise message",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        220,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "executeQuery",
        "query": "INSERT INTO events (workflow, event, detail)\nVALUES ('HL·01', 'message_in', $1::jsonb)\nRETURNING 1 AS logged;",
        "options": {
          "queryReplacement": "={{ [ JSON.stringify({ wa_id: $json.wa_id, message_id: $json.message_id, type: $json.type, chars: $json.text.length }) ] }}"
        }
      },
      "id": "a00c5d3a-2060-4d4b-a591-916af6ba796b",
      "name": "Log message",
